### ==============================================================================
### FastAPI ELK: Dev Tools Modül 03 - ES|QL ile Kök Neden Analizi (Root Cause Analysis - RCA)
### ==============================================================================

### 1. HTTP Durum Kodları Genel Dağılımı (ES|QL)
POST _query
{
  "query": """
    FROM logs-fastapi-*
    | WHERE http.response.status_code IS NOT NULL OR http.status_code IS NOT NULL
    | EVAL status = coalesce(http.response.status_code, http.status_code)
    | STATS count = count() BY status
    | SORT count DESC
  """
}

### 2. En Çok 500 Hatası Veren Endpoint'ler ve Hata Sınıfları (ES|QL)
POST _query
{
  "query": """
    FROM logs-fastapi-*
    | WHERE http.response.status_code >= 500 OR http.status_code >= 500 OR log.level == "ERROR"
    | STATS fail_count = count() BY http.route, error.class
    | SORT fail_count DESC
    | LIMIT 10
  """
}

### 3. Endpoint Bazında Yanıt Süresi Metrikleri (P50, P90, Ortalama ms)
POST _query
{
  "query": """
    FROM logs-fastapi-*
    | WHERE http.duration_ms IS NOT NULL
    | STATS avg_lat = round(avg(http.duration_ms), 2),
            p90_lat = round(percentile(http.duration_ms, 90), 2),
            max_lat = round(max(http.duration_ms), 2),
            total_req = count() BY http.route
    | SORT avg_lat DESC
  """
}

### 4. Kök Neden Analizi (RCA): Son Hata Olaylarının Zaman Damgası ve Detayları
POST _query
{
  "query": """
    FROM logs-fastapi-*
    | WHERE log.level == "ERROR"
    | KEEP @timestamp, http.route, error.class, error.message, http.request.id
    | SORT @timestamp DESC
    | LIMIT 20
  """
}
